# Local-only USD converter artifacts.
#
# The USD loader fetches usd-web-gltf.{js,wasm,data} from the Babylon CDN. Until those are
# published there, main.ts points at this folder in dev builds, so the ~12 MB binaries are
# staged here by hand. They are build outputs of the converter project and must not be
# committed.
public/usd/
